WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.350
When a status board looks stalled, open the card rather than assuming nobody is working on it.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.780
Read the status and owner together, then inspect the latest resolution note for the dependency.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:18.230
If the next shift still owes a test, record a follow-up naming the check; do not mark the repair resolved just to clear the column.
